/// M07 CORE-022 "bundled generation: 4 assert roots green".
/// Source: tests/integration/generation_test.go symbol
/// TestCurrentBundledGeneration.
/// Related fixture: compiler/testdata/current/native/generation.can (read
/// at Go L92, staged pristine as src/main.can at L97 with only the
/// endpoint rewritten to the test server at L96; the blank-ask mutation at
/// L189 and the auth-strip at L202 apply to later legs only, never the
/// assert leg).
/// Disposition: RETAIN (migrate row; the old Go harness stays until the
/// integrator retires it after every linked row, variant, environment and
/// control has accepted evidence).
/// Protects (this file): canlc assert green with a passed report carrying
/// exactly 4 roots grounded per function in generation.can: describe 1,
/// generate 1, select 0 (asks branches only, no asserts block), decide 1,
/// main 1. The report carries the supplied-completion label (Go L119).
/// Live generation semantics (request profile, formats, Choice body,
/// error modes, blank-ask/auth gates, strict tsc) live in
/// core-022-generation-semantics.can; the production process shape lives
/// in core-022-run-shape.can.
/// Variants: none in this file (default only); refusal/truncated/invalid/
/// record (Go L168-185), blank ask (L186-201) and auth omission (L202-208)
/// belong to the generation-semantics file.
/// Environment: CAN_BUN_ARCHIVE + macOS sandbox-exec; requires
/// can-bun-archive, macos-sandbox-exec. CAN_I28_TOKEN is harness-supplied
/// (Go L99/L104: "test-only"), not an external gate. Logical gates
/// SUITE/DIAG/FAULT and C/R/N/S/A identities bind at P23/QHTTP; no live
/// run now. Descriptor timeout 300000ms mirrors the Go 5-minute ctx (L27).
/// Delegated oracles: none.
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (accept_after P23/QHTTP unmet).
/// Case bundled/generation-roots checks: assert-green, report-passed,
/// root-count, fixture-name, describe-roots, generate-roots, select-roots,
/// decide-roots, main-roots, label-supplied.
/// Facet map (generation_test.go legs): assert-green pins the assert leg
/// (L119-121: status 0 and empty diagnostics or the test fatals);
/// report-passed pins the passed report (derived from the L119 exit-0
/// pin: canlc assert exits nonzero on failure); root-count pins the four
/// roots (fixture asserts blocks: describe L33-35, generate L41-43,
/// decide L56-58, main L65-66); fixture-name grounds the pins in the
/// staged fixture (L92: generation.can; L97: src/main.can); describe-roots
/// pins describe (fixture L33-35 drafted, 1 root); generate-roots pins
/// generate (fixture L41-43 planned, 1 root); select-roots pins select
/// (fixture L45-51: asks branches only, no asserts block, 0 roots);
/// decide-roots pins decide (fixture L56-58 chosen, 1 root); main-roots
/// pins main (fixture L65-66 sample, 1 root); label-supplied pins the
/// report label (L119: stdout contains "supplied-completion").
/// Shared old files untouched; retirement is a later integrator decision.
